    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37715" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξυπτιάζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>turn</i> a person <i>quite on the back,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄμμα </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνομα</span> codd.) <i>throw</i> his eyes
			<i>upwards</i> or <i>backwards,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				577
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἑαυτόν</span>
			<i>throwing back</i> his head haughtily, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Cat.</u>
				16
			</span></i>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Gall.</u>
				12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Herc.</u>
				3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ind.</u>
				21
			</span></i>:— 
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξυπτιάζεσθαι τὴν κεφαλήν</span>
			<i>throw</i> it <i>back,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				106
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>lie back,</i> of the horns of wild cattle, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HA</u>
				499a7
			</span></i>.</div>
